# UI standards

The full rules are in `docs/UI.md`. These bans are the ones that are easy to miss:

- Use Ant Design components for controls, layout, and feedback.
- Do not add a `style` prop.
- Put styles in `Component.scss` next to `Component.tsx`, using BEM.
- Do not write raw color values in component SCSS. Use the variables in `src/assets/sass/variables.scss`.
- Use `Row` and `Col`. Set `xs`, `sm`, `md`, `lg`, `xl`, and `xxl` on every column.
- Do not add `@tanstack/react-virtual` or a utility CSS library.
